      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the Python file for starting an OAuth or OIDC authorization-code login, I need to select a concrete external provider and use its identifiable elements in the code. I will choose Google as the provider for this task, as it is a widely used and well-documented OAuth provider. I will use the `google-auth` library to handle the OAuth flow. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
